<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Anadigics said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Anadigics said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs downgraded Anadigics Inc to market outperform from recommended, a source at the firm said.</p>
<p>-- Anadigics warned late last Friday that its third quarter earnings would be &quot;substantially&quot; below its second quarter earnings of $2.1 million, or $0.24 per share.</p>
</text>
